{"unit_id":"licyer__dsh-token-monitor#card-zh","repo":"licyer/dsh-token-monitor","commit":"b86f1cd57701ed599f57eb041b7cb8dd400e7412","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-monitor 是面向 DSH Web 的模型余量与用量监控插件。它在会话头部显示当前提供方的余额或订阅额度，并提供可展开的供应商详情；主区新增用量页签，可查看 token、估算费用、趋势、热力图、排行和请求记录。服务端从会话日志采集用量并保存到本地 SQLite，也支持 CC Switch 导入以及用量 JSON 快照导入导出。可在设置页调整默认时间窗、轮询间隔和记录保留期。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:6214","lib/client.js:6237","lib/index.js:69","lib/index.js:1393"]}
{"unit_id":"licyer__dsh-token-monitor#card-en","repo":"licyer/dsh-token-monitor","commit":"b86f1cd57701ed599f57eb041b7cb8dd400e7412","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-token-monitor tracks provider quotas and token usage in DSH Web. Its session header badge shows a balance or subscription quota. The usage tab charts token totals and estimated costs, with request history. Session logs are stored in SQLite; CC Switch and JSON history can be imported.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:6214","lib/client.js:6237","lib/index.js:69","lib/index.js:1393"]}
